<p class=3DMsoNormal><span lang=3DEN-US>Enter the username: admin, password:
12345678 to log in to the platform. After the first login, the <span
class=3DSpellE>TakeTopDSH</span> Team backend service, <span class=3DSpellE=
>TakeTopDSHLauncher</span>,
runs in the background. <span class=3DGramE>As long as</span> you have not
restarted the computer, you can open the browser and enter this address
http://127.0.0.1:46001 to continue opening the login page. If the launcher =
has
